{"id":"4c42b7b0a71a7e77","group":"20","path":"20/20-prop-index-cylinder.md","title":"外延指标集都是柱","display":"prop-index-cylinder — 外延指标集都是柱","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-prop-index-cylinder","aliases":["20-prop-index-cylinder"],"display":"prop-index-cylinder — 外延指标集都是柱","chapter":"1","section":"1.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 1.6.27(i)","source_printed_pages":[19],"source_pdf_pages":[55],"depends_on":["[[20-df-index-set]]","[[20-df-cylinder]]","[[20-lem-padding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-prop-index-cylinder"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-prop-index-cylinder</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-index-cylinder — 外延指标集都是柱"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 1.6.27(i)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>19</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>55</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f0ae2cb21680ca8b\" href=\"?note=f0ae2cb21680ca8b\" title=\"20-df-index-set\">20-df-index-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4829719bf9cdd6dd\" href=\"?note=4829719bf9cdd6dd\" title=\"20-df-cylinder\">20-df-cylinder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IndexSet}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{IndexSet}(A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f0ae2cb21680ca8b\" href=\"?note=f0ae2cb21680ca8b\" title=\"20-df-index-set\">20-df-index-set</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4829719bf9cdd6dd\" href=\"?note=4829719bf9cdd6dd\" title=\"20-df-cylinder\">20-df-cylinder</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}index\\text{-}cylinder}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Cylinder}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}index\\text{-}cylinder}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Cylinder}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>给 B≤m A 的见证 f，取 padding 的二元整体单射 p(e,t)，令 g(x)=p(f(x),x)。φ_g(x)=φ_f(x)，外延指标性保持目标成员性，且第二参数使 g 单射。这里外延性只用于 A，不要求 B 是指标集。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 1.6.27(i)；印刷页 19；PDF 第 55 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-index-set","status":"resolved","id":"f0ae2cb21680ca8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-index-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"4829719bf9cdd6dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-padding","s